OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry and bright morning
OL,6,Fwith some sunny spells. Cloudy or
OL,7,Fbright during the afternoon with a few
OL,8,Fshowers developing and winds moderate
OL,9,Ffrom the southwest. .
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly cloudy with occasional
OL,12,Frain or showers this evening, becoming
OL,13,Fmainly dry with clear spells
OL,14,Fovernight. However, showers continuing
OL,15,Fthrough Moray and western
OL,16,FAberdeenshire. Breezy.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FBright spells and occasional
OL,19,Fshowers, the showers heavy at times
OL,20,Fand most frequent in the west. Fresh
OL,21,Fto strong west or southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
